{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P1_006", "section": "信達生物製藥", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 1, "pages": [1], "text": "信達生物已經成為腫瘤治療領域的領導品牌,並憑藉不斷擴大的協同產品組合不 斷獲得發展勢頭。此外,綜合產品線作為公司增長的第二生長極,憑藉其極具競 爭力的產品組合 (括瑪仕度肽 (GCG/GLP-1) 、替妥尤單抗 (IGF-1R) 及匹康奇拜單 抗 (IL-23p19) ) 將解鎖高潛慢病市場空間,而該等產品目前正由中國國家藥品監督 管理局審批中。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "自願公告 關於股價及成交量不尋常波動", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/10"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/10", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 1, "bbox": [42.52, 488.01, 552.88, 571.12], "source_block_id": "#/texts/10", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 488.01, 552.88, 571.12], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 8, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4", "chunk_id": "C_eb0fa98d0cac4c86dbb29588", "legacy_paragraph_id": "P1_006", "source_id": "85044f961b76e6db798867b75d47e1808fa000a403e8f064527dab62a5c760a8", "file_sha256": "85044f961b76e6db798867b75d47e1808fa000a403e8f064527dab62a5c760a8", "document_id": "original", "schema_version": "s11-pdf-v1", "text_sha256": "9850b68a232cc8722bf5c497168ba2701e27dc924f14b11801a249822cb15630", "quote_match": null, "printed_pages": [], "quality_flags": [], "linked_note_ids": [], "note_candidates": [], "table_continuation_candidates": [], "section_path": ["信達生物製藥"], "title_candidates": [{"text": "信達生物製藥", "pages": [1], "paragraph_id": "H1_001"}, {"text": "INNOVENT BIOLOGICS, INC.", "pages": [1], "paragraph_id": "H1_002"}, {"text": "自願公告 關於股價及成交量不尋常波動", "pages": [1], "paragraph_id": "H1_003"}], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n信達生物製藥\n[Content]\n信達生物已經成為腫瘤治療領域的領導品牌,並憑藉不斷擴大的協同產品組合不 斷獲得發展勢頭。此外,綜合產品線作為公司增長的第二生長極,憑藉其極具競 爭力的產品組合 (括瑪仕度肽 (GCG/GLP-1) 、替妥尤單抗 (IGF-1R) 及匹康奇拜單 抗 (IL-23p19) ) 將解鎖高潛慢病市場空間,而該等產品目前正由中國國家藥品監督 管理局審批中。", "prev_chunk_id": "C_f2edf70a46003d0976443197", "next_chunk_id": "C_a561e44b85c9d6c7d4fd94d5"